== My Custom Plugin ==

Custom WordPress plugin with a new post type, a custom widget, and additional shortcodes.

== Description ==

This plugin allows you to add a new post type for custom content, a custom widget to your sidebar, and additional shortcodes to format your content.

== Changelog ==

= 1.0.0 =
- Initial release

